  "purpose": "(Clinical Focus: This grouped set of values contains terms representing whether a medication has been consumed according to instructions and includes HL7 Data Absent reasons related to unknown.),(Data Element Scope: The intent of this set of values is identify the degree of adherence to prescribed medication instructions.),(Inclusion Criteria: Includes selected basic adherence terms from the 414059009 | Drug therapy compliance observations (finding) hierarchy and select codes from the HL7 Data Absent Reason code system),(Exclusion Criteria: Other terms from the 414059009 | Drug therapy compliance observations (finding) hierarchy and terms from the HL7 Data Absent Reason code system not related to unknown.)",
